{"createdAt":1785081618674,"expiresAt":1785168018674,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=4216670&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"4216670":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Typing Farmer","steam_appid":4216670,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/e902d2bdc92c7b1141672f4991ff3abd.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We wanted to create a desktop idle game that fits naturally into your day.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>—and thus, <i>Typing Farmer</i> was born!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/1fa0c752d5338966a532c7584ca16f6a.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your keyboard and mouse power the farm! Every keystroke and click helps your crops grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you're typing, your farm keeps working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/9fe7da9cf3fd31bc92d9aca84e97f808.poster.avif?t=1784689229\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/9fe7da9cf3fd31bc92d9aca84e97f808.webm?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/9fe7da9cf3fd31bc92d9aca84e97f808.mp4?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/e26c645ad076137894615f8411295a41.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span>Sell your crops to earn gold and unlock new plants to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bountiful harvest will attract adorable animals to settle on your farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/ce7193a6b235a65df24fce7eb18c4af7.poster.avif?t=1784689229\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/ce7193a6b235a65df24fce7eb18c4af7.webm?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/ce7193a6b235a65df24fce7eb18c4af7.mp4?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/aef68b8dbb5d3f18188d1bc4f0b7b4da.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Renovation Mode to customize your farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the designs of UI entrances such as Storage, Shop, and Mailbox, or purchase decorative items to make your farm truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/2507051ec29859fe175181d243a20079.poster.avif?t=1784689229\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/2507051ec29859fe175181d243a20079.webm?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/2507051ec29859fe175181d243a20079.mp4?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/1dac77f5bbb2c093eade58da62a11c44.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with up to 15 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into cute little animals, visit each other’s farms, share the joy of harvest, and make your tiny farm world feel even more lively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/c70c2fe480a69717130015e48f6811ad.poster.avif?t=1784689229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/c70c2fe480a69717130015e48f6811ad.webm?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/c70c2fe480a69717130015e48f6811ad.mp4?t=1784689229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4216670/extras/5fd630519b3155b1e77f3b0657c2ded8.avif?t=1784689229\" width=780 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay organized with the built-in to-do list and Pomodoro timer, and plan your day at a glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also tracks your daily keyboard presses and mouse clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While growing your farm, you’re also growing your routine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span